---@field Member3                       	UnityEngine.RectTransform               
---@field Member2                       	UnityEngine.RectTransform               
---@field Member1                       	UnityEngine.RectTransform               
---@field TeamMemberGroup               	UnityEngine.RectTransform               
---@field ImgAttribute                  	UnityEngine.RectTransform               
---@field TxtPower                      	UnityEngine.RectTransform               
---@field TxtPlayerName                 	UnityEngine.RectTransform               
---@field TxtPreparing                  	UnityEngine.RectTransform               
